# Optional local configuration for the Review Writer parser resolver.
# This file is documentation only: Review Writer does not auto-load .env files.
# Do not put API keys, tokens, cookies or QoderWork credentials here.

# Absolute path to an installed Review Writer-compatible MinerU parser script.
# The script must be named parse_review_writer_pdfs.py and implement the package
# parser contract. Leave empty to use the normal resolver search/fallback.
REVIEW_WRITER_MINERU_PARSER=

# QoderWork CN login, model selection and Credits are managed by the QoderWork
# Windows client. Review Writer has no product API key to configure.
